ired to create this by the pc game \"Kenshi\". The goal was to create an algorithm whereby an inventory would autosort itself to create space for any new item a user attempted to place with that inventory. After attempting to deduce a method independently, I checked the available pre-existing methods, and found that my solution resembles the \u201cguillotine heuristic\u201d.  It currently has a run time of O(\u22c5Height\u22c5Width\u22c5Items2).","topics":[],"score":218275,"global_rank":240962},{"name":"yzhang37/ProjectSW","owner":"yzhang37","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhang37/ProjectSW","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Lacus X230-NZ666's SW Language Compiler (v1.0.1.0)","topics":["priniciple-of-compiling","sw-compiler","sw-language","symbol-table","virtual-machine"],"score":218265,"global_rank":241014},{"name":"notmahsa/mappro","owner":"notmahsa","html_url":"https://github.com/notmahsa/mappro","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Mapping and route planning software with GUI, using C++ with heavy focus on object oriented programming, route planning algorithms such as Dijkstra's, A*, greedy and multi-end point and various queue and graph data structures.","topics":[],"score":218265,"global_rank":241015},{"name":"coleea/webgpu-dawn-native-cpp","owner":"coleea","html_url":"https://github.com/coleea/webgpu-dawn-native-cpp","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":218262,"global_rank":241021},{"name":"adamgreen/NeoPixelTree","owner":"adamgreen","html_url":"https://github.com/adamgreen/NeoPixelTree","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"mbed LPC1768 example for controlling Adafruit NeoPixels via DMA based SPI output.","topics":[],"score":218257,"global_rank":241124},{"name":"Michaelangel007/palindrome","owner":"Michaelangel007","html_url":"https://github.com/Michaelangel007/palindrome","stars